@APIkey_HostAddress = https://localhost:7039
@JwtToken = reemplazar_con_token_jwt_de_login

### ========================================================
### 1. PRODUCTOS (Consultas y DTOs)
### ========================================================

### Obtener resumen de productos (Total y lista ligera)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### Obtener producto existente por ID
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### ========================================================
### 2. PRUEBAS DE PROBLEM DETAILS (RFC 7807) Y ERRORES
### ========================================================

### Prueba 401: Solicitud sin token JWT (Retorna ProblemDetails en JSON)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Prueba 401: Token JWT inválido (Retorna ProblemDetails en JSON)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer token.invalido.9999

###

### Prueba 404: Producto no encontrado (Retorna ProblemDetails en JSON)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products/999999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### Prueba 400: Validación con DataAnnotations fallida (Campos obligatorios / valores inválidos)
POST {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

{
  "productName": "",
  "unitPrice": -10.00,
  "unitsInStock": -5
}

###

### Prueba 201: Crear producto válido con DTO (requiere ADMIN)
POST {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

{
  "productName": "Teclado Mecanico Escolar",
  "unitPrice": 45.50,
  "unitsInStock": 20,
  "discontinued": false
}

###

### ========================================================
### 3. CLIENTES (Solo CustomerId y Nombre)
### ========================================================

### Obtener lista de clientes (requiere ADMIN o EMPLEADO)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### Obtener cliente por ID
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/customers/ALFKI
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### Prueba 404: Cliente no encontrado
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/customers/NOEXISTE
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### ========================================================
### 4. ÓRDENES (Sin llaves foráneas)
### ========================================================

### Obtener órdenes (requiere ADMIN o EMPLEADO)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### Obtener mis órdenes
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/orders/mine
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### Obtener orden específica por ID
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/orders/10248
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### Prueba 404: Orden no encontrada
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/orders/999999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}

###

### ========================================================
### 5. AUTENTICACIÓN JWT (Registro, Login y Perfil)
### ========================================================

### Registrar un nuevo usuario (Crea el usuario CLIENTE y emite su token JWT)
POST {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "roberth",
  "email": "roberth@itsur.edu.mx",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

###

### Iniciar sesión (Valida credenciales y genera un token JWT Bearer)
POST {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "roberth",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

###

### Probar endpoint protegido usando el token JWT devuelto por Login o Register
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer pega_aqui_tu_jwt

###

### Consultar perfil de sesión y capacidades de UI (validado contra BD, sin nombres de rol)
GET {{APIkey_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{JwtToken}}
